vi-input
========

This module contains a Kotlin port of the Bamboo Vietnamese input method engine
(bamboo-core), https://github.com/BambooEngine/bamboo-core
Ported from commit b2e49a2b48c7d3772a3673142a7747eccd9d5f79 (master, 2024-09-16).

Files containing ported code carry a header naming the upstream source files:
  src/main/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/BambooEngine.kt
  src/main/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/InputMethod.kt
  src/main/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/Transformation.kt
  src/main/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/ViChars.kt
  src/main/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/ViSyllable.kt
Test cases in src/test/kotlin/com/aichat/vi/BambooParityTest.kt are taken from
upstream bamboo_test.go.

Upstream credits (from bamboo-core CREDITS): Trung Ngo, author of bogo.js; Tran Ky Nam,
author of GoTiengViet.

